ecclesiology,"Ecclesiology, ecclesiology",n,C2,"Ecclesiology | ecclesiology | biakinn tuamtuamte kilamdan suutna leh sinna | n. biakinn tuamtuamte kilamdan suutna leh sinna. | Saptuam thu sutna. Leitung a kimu thei thuzuite kipawlna genna hi. Saptuam thu sutna hi a, saptuam pen Thukhun Lui ah omlo in Thukhun Thak ah Zeisu in a pianna ding genkhol in (Mt.16:18), Pentecost Ni ciangin Jerusalem ah Khasiangtho nasepna tawh saptuam piang hi. Saptuam, tapidaw, cih pen kipawlna leh minam hilo in Zeisu a umte bek hi. Israel pen minam hi a, saptuam pen vantung mite hi. Saptuam pen Piter tungah kiphutlo in Zeisu in a kammal tungah phut hi. Saptuam pen sawltakte zangin Pasian in a kammal tawh piangsak hi. Mihing tungah saptuam kilam theilo hi. Saptuam pen a kimu thei leh a kimu theilo namnih om hi. A kimu thei saptuam in leitung ah om a, a piangthak khempeuh mit tawh kimu theilo saptuam sungah kihel hi. Saptuam lutang mihing hilo in Zeisu leh Laisiangtho hi. Saptuam a la dingin Zeisu in meitung tuangin lei ah khatvei hong kumsukkik ding hi. Saptuam in upna hanga hehpihna tawh hotkhiatna ngahte hi. Tuni leh tu hun in hehpihna hun hi in, a sawtlo in bei ding hi. Saptuam, tapidaw, piangthak cih pen Pasian kammal zakna, upna leh hehpihna bek tawh piang hi. Zeisu upna bek tawh Pasian ta kisuak thei in, vantung gamnuam kiluah ding hi.",,,,,,,"Tongdot-DLH, Tongdot-MCPG, Dr. Dal Lian Haokip",,
