elder/eldership,Elder/eldership,noun,C2,"Elder/eldership | elder/eldership | Saptuam makaite, tuucing. Pawlpi sung kalsuanna khempeuh limtak a encikpa, pawlpi a kempa, leh a cingpa hi. Hih pen tuucing, pastor, siampite hi. Greek presbyteros, ‘presbyter, elder’ makaipi, a vanpi, cihna hi in, Greek episkopos, ‘bishop’ leh poimen ‘pastor’ tuucing tawh kizangkhawm hi. Tua ahih manin Manglai a elder, bishop leh pastor cihte kammal kilamdang taleh ‘a nasep kibang’ hi. Pawlpi pawlkhat in elder leh bishop kilamdangsak in, elder niamsak in bishop sangsak zaw a, bishop pen tuucing mun ah, pastor ah, koih uhhi. Makaipi dinmun, elder, pen Paul in Timoti tungah limtak in gen hi (1Tim.3:1-7). Titu tungah zong Paul in na genthuah leuleu hi (Tit.1:5-9). Pawlpi sunga makaipi, elder/pastor in mawhpuakna lian mahmah nam 4: hilhna, makaihna, thungetsakna leh kepcingna, hi.",,,,,,,"Tongdot-MCPG, Dongdot, Dr. Mang Cin Pau Gualnam",,
