elements,Elements,noun,C2,"Elements | Nekkhawm sunga kihel nate. Saptuam tungah sep leh zuih dinga hong kisawl thu nih sung pan khat hi a, hih in Topa Nitak Ankuang tawh kizom in, tua sunga van leh nate, moh leh lenggah tui genna hi. Zeisu in galte khutsung a tunma in nungzuite tawh nitak ankuang umkhawm a, moh la in hih in ka sa leh ka pumpi hi, ci hi. Moh in Zeisu pumpi a genna hi a, Zeisu pumpi taktak suaklo banah Zeisu ci leh sa kihello hi. Zeisu in hai la in, cih pen, lenggah tui a lakna hi a, note a dinga kibuakhia ka sisan hi, ci hi. Hih hun in Zeisu si nailo ahih manin lenggah tui pen Zeisu sisan lim bek hi. Tuni in Nekkhawm i nek ciangin lenggah tui pen Zeisu sisan tawh kilaih lo banah lenggah tui sungah Zeisu sisan kihello hi. Zeisu sisan leh pumpi in a sihna tawh beisuak a, moh leh lenggah tui sungah kihel theilo hi. Tua banah kilaihna zong omlo hi. Nekkhawm i nek ciangin, Pasian itna leh Zeisu hotkhiatna hanga kingah thuphate kiphawk phasan ahih manin nekkhawm ah Pasian thupha, khalam thupha, om hi. Mihingte in Pasian i phawk theihna pen Pasian hehpihna hi a, tua in Pasian thupha hi. | elements",,,,There are more intimate elements.,,,"Tongdot-MCPG, Dongdot, Dr. Mang Cin Pau Gualnam",,
