forensic,Forensic,adj,C2,"giitloh saat lohna-a kizangh vante a sawtpi nunga kankhiatna lam tawh kisai | Forensic | Thukhun tawh kizui a dikna. Hotkhiatna thu tawh kizom a, thukhun tawh kizui a diksakna hi. Diktansakna pen mihingte sep hilo in Pasian in dik hi, siangtho hi, ci a hong tangkona leh kipsakna hi. Gamtat hoihna hang hilo in Pasian dikna leh itna eite tungah hong kilawh manin Pasian mai ah dikna kingah hi. Abraham in sepna tawh dikkisakna ngahlo in a upna pen Pasian in dikna in ciamteh hi. Upna kihello in Pasian mai ah dikkisakna ngahna ding lampi omlo hi. Leitung mite sung pan a sia pen ihih hangin Pasian in upna i neih zawh teh dikna hong pia in, siangtho teh, dik teh hong ci hi. Pasian in hong diksak a, mihingte sepna tawh dikna leh sianthona kingah theilo hi. | adj. giitloh saat lohna-a kizangh vante a sawtpi nunga kankhiatna lam tawh kisai. Gentehna-in: gampalak-ah misi khat kimu-a tua misi pen a guh bek om ta hi. Thu kan siamte'n tua mi pen bang hanga si hiam cih a guh tung pan theih sawm ding uh-a, mi tha hiam, gu ne-a si cihte theihkhe thei uh hi. Mi khat a sihna hang kithei lo bang zongh kansiamte'n a taksa tung khawng, a si khawng panin a sihdan thei khe thei uh hi. KANSIAM. | thukhenzum thukhun tawh kisai thukhen zum a thupulakna tawh kisai",,,,Layla pen forensic archaeologist hi.,,,"Tongdot-DLH, Tongdot-MCPG, Dr. Dal Lian Haokip",,
