ordinances,Ordinances,noun,C2,"Ordinances | Pawlpi zuih ding thunih. Cituamna lahna dinga Zeisu in pawlpi tungah sep leh bawl dinga hong sawl lim nihte hi. Khat pen Tuiphumna hi in, a dang khat pen Nekkhawm hi. Hotkhiatna ngahna ding hilo in upna tawh Pasian ta suahna lahna hi. RC in sacraments cih kammal tawh upna zungpi 7 nei a, hihte pen hotkhiatna ngahna dingin zui uhhi. Tuiphumna pen Zeisu tawh sihkhopna leh sihna pan thawhkikna, Pasian mite tawh kipumkhatna banah Pasian tawh kipumkhatna lahna hi. A piangthakte in Pa min, Tapa min leh Khasiangtho min tawh tui kiphum ding hi (Mt.28:19-20). Hih in Zeisu thupiak hi. Nekkhawm, Topa Nitak Ankuang, pen updan tuamtuam om hi. Zeisu in na bawl un hong ci ahih manin bawl ding hi. RC upna ah siampite in moh leh lenggah tui thupha a piakkhit ciangin Zeisu pumpi leh sisan tawh kilaih hi (transubstantiation). Lutherante upna ah siampite in moh leh lenggah tui thupha a piakkhit ciangin Zeisu pumpi leh sisan kihel hi (consubstantiation). Reformedte in nekkhawm ah khalam thupha om ci hi. Tui kiphumte in Zeisu hong sepsaksa thute phawkna ciang tawh kibawl hi. Hih pen Zwingli tung pan kiluahsuk hi. Nekkhawm i zat ciangin Pasian itna leh Zeisu thuakna kiphawk ahih manin Khalam thupha om takpi cih kimu hi. | ordinances",,,,I Topa Jesu Christ in saptuamte kaingah,,,"Tongdot-MCPG, Dongdot, Dr. Mang Cin Pau Gualnam",,
