protoevangelium,protoevangelium,noun,C2,"protoevangelium | Lungdamna thu a masa bel tangkona. Leitung ah mawhna hong lut ciangin Pasian in mawhneite kihotkhiatna ding lungdamna thu tangkona na neipah a, tua pen Piancilna 3:15 hi. Hih in a masa pen lungdamna thu tangkona hi. Pasian in a bawlsa mihingte it mahmah ahih manin mawhna pan a honkhia ding, honkhiapa Zeisu, hong paisakna ding hih mun ah tangko hi. Leitung ah Zeisu mihing banga hong paina pen Pasian in tangtawng a kipan a gelsa hi in (Efe.1:4), Zeisu in a mangte a zong ding leh a honkhia dingin hong pai in (Lk.19:10), mawhneite tang dingin sihna hong thuak in (Rom 5:8), a sep ding khempeuh zosiang hi (Jn.19:30). Sih dongin thumaan a, sihna in len zolo in thokik in vantung ah kahto a, Pa ziatlam ah eite a dingin thu hong ngetsak hi. | Protoevangelium",,,,,,,"Tongdot-MCPG, Dongdot, Dr. Mang Cin Pau Gualnam",,
