sex/sexuality,sex/sexuality,noun,C2,"sex/sexuality | Numei leh pasal omkhopna. Mihingte sungah numei leh pasal omkhopna, kizopna bek hilo in ganhingte sungah zong a nu leh a pate in khuahun zui in kizopna nei hi. Pasian pen kha ahih manin hih mihingte nopsak mahmah nupa kizopna neilo hi. Pasian in mihingte numei leh pasal in piangsak a, hih numei leh pasal omkhopna bawlsak hi, phal hi. Numei leh pasal kizopna pen Pasian piak hi. Leitung ah Adam leh Eve bek om ding deihlo ahih manin Pasian in mi tampi om ding deih a, numei leh pasal, nupa kitenna, tawh ta tampi neih ding thupha pia hi (Pian.1:28). Numei leh pasal omkhopna pen Pasian patkhiat ahih mah bangin (1) Zi leh pasal bek omkhopna leh kizopna hi dinga, khuavalna tawh hilo ding hi. (2) Nupa omkhopna kizopna pen nopsak mahmahna ding, lungsim leh pumpi kigawmkhop semsemna ding, kihehnepna ding, kipumkhatna ding, khanna ding leh khuavalna tawh gamtatna ding pan kidalna hi. Kiten khit ciangin, nupa suahkhit ciangin, nupa omkhopna leh kizopna pen Pasian minthanna dinga zat ding hi. Nupa kizahtakna ding leh kithupi bawlna dinga zat ding hi. | Sex/sexuality",,,,,,,"Tongdot-MCPG, Dongdot, Dr. Mang Cin Pau Gualnam",,
